 "dialogue": {
  "Dex Moreau|So you are Lou's miracle worker. Charming. I have a problem with a mouth.": "dlg-dex-02cf79984f",
  "Dex Moreau|Benny Two-Tone is driving to the police with my name in his notebook. Make sure he never arrives.": "dlg-dex-82b6a93f20",
  "Dex Moreau|Benny slipped through my fingers today. Come back later.": "dlg-dex-6a6ef037b4",
  "Dex Moreau|Benny will be very quiet from now on. Come see me, there is more.": "dlg-dex-79c2898804",
  "Dex Moreau|The Tiburones keep three vans full of my merchandise. They stole it. I want it gone.": "dlg-dex-7bf9902256",
  "Dex Moreau|Burn every van. A gift for the job.": "dlg-dex-8c437a3465",
  "Dex Moreau|I can smell it from my balcony. Wonderful. Now, the real job...": "dlg-dex-7afa81a26d",
  "Dex Moreau|First Azura Bank. The vault opens on a timer: twenty seconds, and the whole city will hear it.": "dlg-dex-55eff2b8a1",
  "Dex Moreau|Hold the entrance, take the car outside, and my boat waits at the Marina. Do not be late.": "dlg-dex-e89a71fe0b",
  "Dex Moreau|Twenty-five grand for you, the rest for me. Welcome to the top of San Azura, Kai.": "dlg-dex-349365a26b",
  "Mama Lou|Kai Navarro! Six years inside and not one postcard. Welcome home, baby.": "dlg-lou-2801376397",
  "Mama Lou|You need money, I need cars. Steal one and bring it to my garage in the Docks.": "dlg-lou-1f4faede43",
  "Mama Lou|Kai Navarro! Six years inside and you still walk like you own the street.": "dlg-lou-f710a05793",
  "Mama Lou|You need money, I need cars. Bring me one. Any car. I don't ask whose.": "dlg-lou-6e337569cb",
  "Mama Lou|Not bad, baby. Not bad at all. Come see me again, I'll have real work.": "dlg-lou-1ae35c389b",
  "Mama Lou|One of my boys dropped a package in a Midtown parking lot. Don't ask what's in it.": "dlg-lou-0aae9cc777",
  "Mama Lou|Buyer waits in Hillcrest. He gets nervous, he walks. Move it!": "dlg-lou-99b6b9d33d",
  "Mama Lou|Buyer's happy, I'm happy. Here's your cut.": "dlg-lou-65f0b6362a",
  "Mama Lou|The Tiburones owe me a car: a red Nightjar GT, parked in Westside with three of them babysitting it.": "dlg-lou-92db3b42ef",
  "Mama Lou|Take this. Bring the car back without too many holes in it.": "dlg-lou-6facbe3c61",
  "Mama Lou|You call this a delivery? I pay for cars, not scrap. Less money.": "dlg-lou-73360b280e",
  "Mama Lou|Look at that paint. You're my favorite now.": "dlg-lou-7d51487ac2",
  "Mama Lou|A friend of mine, Dex Moreau, wants to meet you. Moreau Tower, downtown. Be nice to him.": "dlg-lou-2b2b8e773d",
  "Vera Salgado|So you are the one who emptied the First Azura. Dex talks too much, but he was right about you.": "dlg-vera-7c711f1bf9",
  "Vera Salgado|A Tiburones courier leaves from up the street. Follow him to his buyer. Close enough to see, never close enough to be seen.": "dlg-vera-cc36c200f7",
  "Vera Salgado|An SAPD sergeant buying from the Tiburones. That is worth more than money. Come by the hotel.": "dlg-vera-26104efb5b",
  "Vera Salgado|The sergeant told the Tiburones who was watching. Now they are coming here. To my hotel.": "dlg-vera-bfd9425a99",
  "Vera Salgado|Take this and hold the door. Nobody walks into Hotel Salgado without a reservation.": "dlg-vera-248c46ef37",
  "Vera Salgado|Not one of them got through the door. I like you, Kai. I have a buyer who will like you too.": "dlg-vera-35774ca245",
  "Vera Salgado|A collector wants a yellow Nightjar GT. One is parked in Midtown, with two Tiburones minding it.": "dlg-vera-a1cc1d2de4",
  "Vera Salgado|He pays for showroom condition. Below 70 percent, he pays half. Drive like it is your mother's.": "dlg-vera-af97660ee2",
  "Vera Salgado|He looked at the dents and paid half. Half, Kai.": "dlg-vera-4388323c61",
  "Vera Salgado|Not a scratch. The collector cried a little. Here is your money.": "dlg-vera-792966ed0b",
  "Vera Salgado|The Tiburones pay the sergeant tonight. Two cars, one envelope of cash in each.": "dlg-vera-f36bcdf26d",
  "Vera Salgado|The Dustrunner outside is heavier than anything they drive. Push them off the road.": "dlg-vera-f7dd600521",
  "Vera Salgado|Both envelopes, and the sergeant has nothing to pay his debts with. Beautiful work.": "dlg-vera-9e1abffc5f",
  "Vera Salgado|Three of my runners hold envelopes for me across town. The banks close soon, and the envelopes must be here first.": "dlg-vera-4ba9df8b68",
  "Vera Salgado|Take the Thunderhoof. Do not stop to admire the view.": "dlg-vera-680e7dc784",
  "Vera Salgado|With time to spare. Now, Kai, the real job. The sergeant keeps his ledger in the SAPD impound.": "dlg-vera-245bba9d7d",
  "Vera Salgado|The sergeant keeps a ledger: every payment, every name. Mine too. It sits in an evidence box in the impound lot by SAPD Central.": "dlg-vera-909e0a553e",
  "Vera Salgado|The moment you touch it the whole station comes out. Take the rifle, grab the box, and lose them.": "dlg-vera-6b6cf0ca35",
  "Vera Salgado|The ledger is in my safe and the sergeant is on a plane. San Azura is ours, Kai.": "dlg-vera-a565408024",
  "Mama Lou|You've got your hands full. Call me when you're done.": "dlg-lou-b977188d6c",
  "Mama Lou|Nothing for you right now. I'll call you.": "dlg-lou-480a032c6a",
  "Dex Moreau|You've got your hands full. Call me when you're done.": "dlg-dex-b977188d6c",
  "Dex Moreau|Nothing for you right now. I'll call you.": "dlg-dex-480a032c6a",
  "Vera Salgado|You've got your hands full. Call me when you're done.": "dlg-vera-b977188d6c",
  "Vera Salgado|Nothing for you right now. I'll call you.": "dlg-vera-480a032c6a",
  "Mama Lou|I've got work for you: \"Wheels\". Come see me, L on your radar.": "dlg-lou-7f67c3ed68",
  "Mama Lou|I've got work for you: \"Hot Delivery\". Come see me, L on your radar.": "dlg-lou-e43c5c4b71",
  "Mama Lou|I've got work for you: \"Repo Man\". Come see me, L on your radar.": "dlg-lou-8ffd3987d5",
  "Dex Moreau|I've got work for you: \"Loose Lips\". Come see me, D on your radar.": "dlg-dex-ee383e3219",
  "Dex Moreau|I've got work for you: \"Heatwave\". Come see me, D on your radar.": "dlg-dex-2ba354e936",
  "Dex Moreau|I've got work for you: \"The Big Score\". Come see me, D on your radar.": "dlg-dex-f4a7759e65",
  "Vera Salgado|I've got work for you: \"Shadow Play\". Come see me, V on your radar.": "dlg-vera-9cd199663f",
  "Vera Salgado|I've got work for you: \"Room Service\". Come see me, V on your radar.": "dlg-vera-c0546cb0e3",
  "Vera Salgado|I've got work for you: \"Showroom Condition\". Come see me, V on your radar.": "dlg-vera-b2441279ae",
  "Vera Salgado|I've got work for you: \"Off the Road\". Come see me, V on your radar.": "dlg-vera-783a4b7d31",
  "Vera Salgado|I've got work for you: \"Rush Hour\". Come see me, V on your radar.": "dlg-vera-30638ba1ac",
  "Vera Salgado|I've got work for you: \"Last Call\". Come see me, V on your radar.": "dlg-vera-aeb7767d0a"
 },
